      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_d_07_select_03",
      "hash64": "9CDF95736583E98F",
      "text": "Sorpresa",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_d_07_select_04",
      "hash64": "9CDF92736583E476",
      "text": "¿Puedo escucharlo otra vez?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_answer_01",
      "hash64": "2EFDD0FDDC43E69C",
      "text": "Well done, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]!\\nYo sí que me alegro de que hayas acertado.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_answer_02",
      "hash64": "2EFDD3FDDC43EBB5",
      "text": "Por suerte para Pikachu, yo diría que no parecía\\nestar sufriendo, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_answer_03",
      "hash64": "2EFDD2FDDC43EA02",
      "text": "¡Vaya! ¿De veras te ha parecido que estaba\\nsorprendido, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_10",
      "hash64": "F78406D5B9B78CC1",
      "text": "La forma de Pikachu de decir...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_d_07_poke_03",
      "hash64": "01CFAF9AF1E7E7C4",
      "text": "¡Chuuu!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_11",
      "hash64": "F78405D5B9B78B0E",
      "text": "¡Es su forma de expresar lo alegre que está!\\c\\nUna alegría contagiosa de esas que te provocan\\nganas de bailar.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_12",
      "hash64": "F78404D5B9B7895B",
      "text": "Os complacerá saber que lo de hoy no era una\\nactuación. Pikachu está muy contento de haber\\r\\npodido compartir esta clase con todos vosotros.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 141,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_13",
      "hash64": "F78403D5B9B787A8",
      "text": "Tanto él como yo nos alegramos de haber tenido\\nla ocasión...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_14",
      "hash64": "F7840AD5B9B7938D",
      "text": "¡De enseñar a un grupo tan magnífico como el\\nvuestro![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_15",
      "hash64": "F78409D5B9B791DA",
      "text": "He aquí el último de mis consejos, mis amantes\\nde las palabras.[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_16",
      "hash64": "F78408D5B9B79027",
      "text": "¡Nuestras vidas están plagadas de emociones!\\c\\nHabrá veces en las que nos hagan enfadar, otras\\nen las que nos entren ganas de llorar...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_17",
      "hash64": "F78407D5B9B78E74",
      "text": "Pero, conforme circunnavegamos todos los altos\\ny bajos de esta vida, es imprescindible no\\r\\nolvidarse de lo más importante. En una palabra...[VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_18",
      "hash64": "F783FED5B9B77F29",
      "text": "¡Sonreír! Porque al final del camino nos aguarda\\nla felicidad casi con total seguridad. Smile![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_d_07_poke_04",
      "hash64": "01CFAE9AF1E7E611",
      "text": "¡Chuuu!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_19",
      "hash64": "F783FDD5B9B77D76",
      "text": "Confiad siempre en quien os tienda una mano\\nen los momentos más frágiles de vuestra vida.\\c\\nYa sean vuestros profesores, vuestra familia o\\nvuestros amigos... ¡Siempre tendréis a alguien\\r\\nque os ayude a superar el bache![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 186,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 222,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0026"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "class_d_07_language_20",
      "hash64": "F7870CD5B9B9CCCA",
      "text": "La próxima vez que nos veamos será en el\\nexamen final. Repasad muy bien todo lo que\\r\\nhemos dado hasta la fecha.\\c\\n¡Hasta luego! Bye-bye, sayōnara![VAR 0x0114(0026)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
